From: VipinVIP <VipinVIP@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: novatek,nt36672e: add nt36672a-shenchao

Add the NT36672A 'shenchao' panel compatible used by the Redmi Note 7 Pro.
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36672e.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/novatek,nt36672e.yaml
@@ -14,7 +14,9 @@
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: novatek,nt36672e
+    enum:
+      - novatek,nt36672a-shenchao
+      - novatek,nt36672e
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
